name net-jam-wire-1
timeout 320

# A WIRE IS NOT JAMMABLE, and that is a modelling STATEMENT rather than a waiver.
# doc/air-defence-network.md §2 and acceptance criterion 9.
#
# This file is `net-jam-late.fbm` with ONE line changed — `link radio 60000 mast 8` becomes `link wire`
# — and nothing else. The same jammer flies the same geometry into the same radius. A buried cable is
# not subject to a radio horizon and cannot be swamped at the receiver's front end, so the link simply
# does not notice.
#
# A second F-16 carries `set jam_comm_m 25000`. It is INAUDIBLE — it publishes no emitter signature at
# all, so nothing can bear on it and there is no home-on-jam — and it denies exactly one thing: the
# RECEIVER's link, on geometry, with no die and no ramp. Radar, RWR, IRST, the eye and every seeker are
# untouched, which is what `net-jam-wire.fbm` and the `site` lines here are the proof of.
#
# It is also the second half of "jamming denies the link and NOTHING else": the `site` chain here is
# the unjammed baseline every other run of the trio is compared against.
#
# WHAT TO READ:
#   events.log      ZERO `net LOST` lines, and the full `site STATE ... to=TRACK -> to=ENGAGE ->
#                   site LAUNCH` chain the radio run loses
#
# READING RULE: the battery engages whichever aircraft its own radar holds, and on this geometry that is
# the JAMMER — which is exactly the point of an inaudible jammer that has to fly close. Exit 1 = FAIL
# with `UNIT_RESULT jammer FAIL` is the EXPECTED verdict. The MEASUREMENT is the count of `net LOST`
# lines (the only passing value is ZERO) and the `site TRACK` line, which is byte-identical to the one
# `net-jam-late.fbm` produces under jamming.

net iads
  control ew
  link wire                                     # a buried cable: the SAME geometry, unjammable
  period 4.0
  hold 3
  wcs free
  member ew
  member sam autonomy hold                      # cut off from control, this battery waits

unit viper
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.25000 6.90000 3000 0.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 60
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr on
  wp 46.85000 6.90000 3000 450

unit jammer
  module f16
  team friendly
  spawn 46.30000 6.60000 6000 30.0 450
  set gear up
  set fuel_pct 80
  set fcr_mode off
  set rwr off
  set jam_comm_m 25000                          # [SET] one radius, one geometry, no J/S and no ramp
  wp 46.90000 6.95000 6000 450

unit ew
  module p18
  team hostile
  spawn 46.62000 7.10000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon free

unit sam
  module sa6
  team hostile
  spawn 46.75000 6.90000 ground 0.0 0
  set emcon hold
  set rounds 3
